WEBVTT

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.760
"Till prefecturals"
"30 days"

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:21.890
"Must Beat"

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:32.030
Why the smirking?

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:34.700
We're eating together again.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:42.200
And I heard from Sae--oh, Eitaro's
sister--that you showed up at club.

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:44.750
Yeah.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:46.750
Can I watch your game?

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:49.790
Don't. We might lose.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:52.510
Win or lose, it's no big deal.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:57.090
I'm playing on a team
I don't like just to win.

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:02.560
Does it make you happy
that I play water polo?

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:05.560
It does.

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:09.400
Because it makes living
with yourself easier?

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:17.570
Because you'd feel guilty if the
accident was the reason I quit?

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:18.820
Minato.

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:20.450
Well?

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:31.090
I'm sorry about the accident.
But that's not why I want you to play.

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:37.380
I want you to do what you love.
That's my only wish.

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:39.260
Yeah?

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:45.520
All I want is to show Shogaku who's boss.

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:27.040
One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.120
--Two, two, three, four, five, six...

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:31.290
--Ah, our first official match...
--Two, two, three, four, five, six...

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:32.120
"Water Polo Club"

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:34.580
We've come so far.

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:40.260
"Episode 10:
It's the Only Way I Know To Win"
The question is, how do
we improve in a month?

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:42.630
"Episode 10:
It's the Only Way I Know To Win"
We can start with practice matches--

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:43.260
We can start with practice matches--

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:46.300
From now on, we'll train how I say.

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:47.510
Huh?

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:56.520
Captain will do keeper practice.
You, you, and you practice swimming.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:59.900
Huh, what? Why?

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:05.070
We play twice at prefecturals.
Do you have enough stamina?

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:10.750
Um... What about us?

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:13.210
You'll practice "hands up."

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:14.830
"Hands up"?

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:17.040
You don't even know it?

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:20.460
It's keeping a hand up to block the ball.

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:25.340
But just one, since only the keeper
can put both above water.

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:30.470
When defending, keep your hands up
even when you're tired. Got it?

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:32.310
--Mmm.
--Yeah.

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:39.230
I'll do my own training. My body won't
move how I want, so I'll address that.

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:40.980
Hold up!

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:41.990
Huh?

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:46.160
Why are you acting all haughty?
You lost your talent.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:50.950
I've got knowledge and experience.
Why shouldn't I give advice?

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:54.410
Show our captain more respect.

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:57.630
We're the same age.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.420
Got a problem?

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:05.430
It's okay. You don't have
to treat me like your elder.

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:09.140
But our strategy will revolve around me.

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:10.760
Huh?

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:13.270
It's the only way I know to win.

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:15.890
So, like our practice match?

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:18.690
So, get the ball to Minato-<i>senpai</i>!

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:20.230
Everyone on board?

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:25.950
Bullshit! The game plan's been
for us to score! Right, Amiami?

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:29.160
As long as we win, I don't care.

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:30.030
But--

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:33.500
Now, now. Let's just try it.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:38.920
Our endurance is lacking anyway.
We'll put our plan on hold.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:40.340
On hold?

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:45.510
If you get your groove back
by the match, it's all you.

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:50.930
But if not, Buu and Amiami
take over. Well?

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:52.850
All right.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:18.580
He's testing out the limits of his body.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:22.790
I feel like he's jumping
even higher than before.

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:28.340
That's nothing. Not compared to his prime.

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:31.640
He used his jumping height as a weapon.

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:36.520
That, and his flexible shoulders,
made his feint possible.

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:40.690
No matter the keeper, he was unstoppable.

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:45.400
And I might get to see it again.

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:49.240
Time to go.

00:06:53.320 --> 00:07:01.210
It's bullshit... I've been pushing hard...
I thought I'd get a chance this time.

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:15.760
At least tell me why!
Why can't I sit on the bench?!

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:19.640
Unfortunately, there're lots
of players of your caliber.

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:27.320
Homer, homer, Takahashi! Homer,
homer, Takahashi! Homer, homer...!

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:32.660
Participating isn't enough.

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:39.000
I wanna play like a star to prove
that I've got talent... to myself.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:40.790
"Till prefecturals"
"25 days"

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:42.290
"Till prefecturals"
"24 days"

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:55.720
Back then, he could easily hold it
over his head for a minute.

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:59.060
Yeah, he'll play in the matches.

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:04.190
Good, Momo will be pleased.
He thought he might quit.

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:10.820
Still, I doubt Minato-<i>senpai </i>will
be anything like he used to be.

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:12.780
I see.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:20.660
So when we play you guys,
please go easy on us.

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:24.080
I'll think about it. Bye.

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:26.380
Yeah, thanks.

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:34.220
I shouldn't be worrying
about other people.

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:41.310
This will be my first official match
as a starter... Talk about nervous.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:42.810
"Till prefecturals"
"20 days"

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:44.230
"Till prefecturals"
"19 days"

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:53.360
Wanna take a break?

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:55.200
Yeah.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:08.540
Has he been swimming for an hour?

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:09.840
Yeah.

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:20.680
I don't wanna pull the team down!

00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:33.280
Let's try to swim with our hands
even higher tomorrow, okay?

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:38.240
"Till prefecturals"
"15 days"

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:39.740
"Till prefecturals"
"14 days"

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:49.540
Mom, I think I'll finally tell Dad
that I play water polo.

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:51.460
Wish me luck.

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:55.130
Hey, got a sec?

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:58.260
Hmm? Sure.

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:03.140
Dad, um...

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:04.680
What is it?

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:07.810
A-Are you busy July 18th?

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:12.860
Hmm? Saturday? I have work.

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:16.150
Oh. Then forget it.

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:17.610
What's this about?

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:19.450
It's nothing!

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:30.960
Gah, I couldn't say it! Huh?

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:34.460
Hey! Good morning!

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.130
Huh? Yeah.

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:38.680
Huh? Morning practice?

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:40.890
Yeah, I should've asked.

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:44.310
It's fine. Don't push too hard.

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:48.270
I have to. There's not enough time.

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:53.650
"Till prefecturals"
"10 days"

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:55.190
"Till prefecturals"
"9 days"

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:14.170
Whoa! Good thing I didn't say we'd stop
when he does! He's going forever!

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:21.510
Ah, I'm starving.

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:26.810
I could go for some <i>crémet</i>
<i>d'anjou</i>. How about you?

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:31.600
"Till prefecturals"
"6 days"

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:33.100
"Till prefecturals"
"5 days"

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:43.820
Seriously?

00:11:57.090 --> 00:12:01.130
In just days, I'll battle my brother.

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:02.380
Hey.

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:07.100
You're Momo's little brother, right?

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:09.140
How did you know?

00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:11.230
Old me's videos.

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:12.350
Old you?

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:18.320
Pass along a message to Momo:
"I've decided to beat you."

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:30.370
After they're done,
do an eight-minute match.

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:31.910
--Okay.
--Also--

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:37.130
Momo!

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:40.630
Shit!

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:58.360
That sound...

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:00.400
Wall passes.

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:05.070
I've gotta focus, too!

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:14.710
Mom must still be at work.
As usual, she's working late.

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:18.340
I hope she doesn't overdo it.

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:20.500
"Momosaki Construction"

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:20.500
I hope she doesn't overdo it.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:21.090
"July 13"
"Monday"

00:13:21.090 --> 00:13:26.380
Is my brother really
training till this late?

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:38.310
It's not a big deal.

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:41.150
It's a torn muscle, though.

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:43.820
I'm fine. It'll heal.

00:13:45.320 --> 00:13:49.990
But it'll take two weeks.
I'm out of prefecturals.

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:51.370
I see.

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:55.120
Dammit! I thought we'd finally face off.

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:58.000
I wish we could've.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:01.880
Huh? Oh, against you, too.

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:07.130
I wanted to crush Minato
and prove I'm better.

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:10.180
This again...

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:11.850
Hmm?

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:18.650
What will it take for you to see me?
Am I worthless as a rival?

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:23.940
Is Minato that amazing of a player?

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:28.950
You've got a habit
of rattling off questions.

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:31.410
"OM Swimming School"

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:33.870
How are you so fast at swimming?

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:38.750
How do you breathe and swim?
Can I wear your same swimsuit?

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:44.880
Answer one: I'll take notice of you
when you manage to beat me.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:50.180
Answer two: You haven't beat me,
so you're not a worthy rival.

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:54.560
You keep chasing me
'cuz you haven't beat me.

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:58.600
I can tell how you've wanted to, though.

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:02.690
I'm sorry for quitting swimming.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:08.360
I just had to play with Minato.

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:10.860
And to answer your last question...

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:18.660
He's incredible. The speed at
which he learns is inhuman.

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:23.000
As his teammate,
I felt both hope and despair.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:25.250
Hope and despair?

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:32.300
The despair of being shown your limits.
The hope he brought to your team.

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:35.890
I'm guessing you've felt neither.

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:40.230
Because my eyes were always on you.

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:42.940
My eyes were always on Minato.

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:47.530
Get well soon.

00:15:49.490 --> 00:15:56.790
Oh, he wanted me to tell you:
"I've decided to beat you."

00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:58.450
Got it.

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:05.250
"Till prefecturals"
"5 days"

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:06.750
"Till prefecturals"
"4 days"

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.580
So high...

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:47.000
Yeah.

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:50.170
Hey, go change.

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:52.880
You're late. What's up?

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:56.140
My brother got hurt and can't compete.

00:16:56.140 --> 00:16:57.140
--What?
--Huh?

00:16:57.140 --> 00:17:01.980
So I've been reconsidering
my reasons for playing.

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:04.770
Huh? I-Is he quitting?!

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:05.650
What?

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:09.980
'Cuz he's only playing
to beat his brother!

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:15.820
Before, it's possible I may have quit.

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:23.540
But after three months with you guys,
I want to see how far our team can go.

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:30.000
Also, seeing Minato like this, I sorta
get what my brother was saying.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:35.510
Even if I can't play against my brother,
I wanna try playing with Minato.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:41.600
True, he is kinda amazing.

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:50.150
Till now, I thought I'd been working
really hard, but how naïve can I be?

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:57.570
He puts in full effort and never
lets off the gas. That's talent.

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:00.450
You okay?

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:03.450
Captain, let's build around Minato.

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:04.330
Huh?

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:07.540
That's our best strategy to win.

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:09.330
I agree.

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:12.090
I see. What do you think?

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:13.460
Yeah!

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:19.890
Looks like we're gonna center
our team around you.

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:22.260
Huh? Why?

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:27.600
Well, that's fine.

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:31.230
All right! Lez do this!

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:32.440
Hmm?

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:35.240
That takes me back.

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:36.070
Huh?

00:18:36.070 --> 00:18:40.280
He's really Minato after all.

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:42.580
I don't get it.

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:53.750
Why the smirks?

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.050
Beats me.

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:57.340
Oh, I wanted to ask...

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:58.340
Yeah?

00:18:58.340 --> 00:19:03.560
The first years are slacking lately.
Can you talk to 'em?

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:06.180
Sure.

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:10.150
Sorry, but they listen to you more.

00:19:10.150 --> 00:19:11.980
Yeah.

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:13.940
That's tough.

00:19:13.940 --> 00:19:20.570
Yeah. It's nice for our captain to rely
on me, but I've got my hands full.

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:26.910
I don't have my act together, so I wanna
only think about myself before games.

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:31.670
If you don't like it, say so.
Be more selfish.

00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:35.130
I don't wanna be like Minato.

00:19:36.340 --> 00:19:41.720
Rather than ruin things for
my teammates, I'll put up with it.

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:47.220
It's your call, but don't worry about me.

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:48.100
Huh?

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:52.270
I told you: The team got
stronger because of him.

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:56.150
And thanks to me quitting,
I found table tennis.

00:19:56.150 --> 00:20:02.320
It's not about you, Hiro.
I just hate the guy.

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:05.080
Well, good luck at the tourney.

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:07.450
Thanks, and sorry.

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:11.620
Talking to you before games calms me down.

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:13.580
I'm always open ears.

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:16.250
Sorry to keep you, Ichinose!

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:17.750
Hello, Chinu.

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:19.130
Hello.

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:22.130
Your match is soon, right? Good luck!

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:23.800
Thank you.

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:25.050
See you.

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:26.510
--Mmm.
--Bye.

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:29.100
Oh, I tried that chocolate bar.

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:30.560
Wasn't it good?

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:33.020
That thing was delicious!

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:35.610
"Till prefecturals"
"4 days"

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:37.070
"Till prefecturals"
"3 days"

00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:43.610
"Till prefecturals"
"3 days"

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:44.780
"Till prefecturals"
"2 days"

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:51.450
"2 days"

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:52.580
"1 day"

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:04.260
Thanks for the meal.

00:21:04.260 --> 00:21:06.090
Huh? You're done?

00:21:06.090 --> 00:21:10.470
I'm sleeping early and
don't want an upset stomach.

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:17.310
What?

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:23.150
Uh, are push-ups a bad idea
on the night before a game?

00:21:23.150 --> 00:21:24.280
Huh?

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:26.410
Like, lactic acid buildup.

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:29.700
If you really want to, just do it.

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:31.240
I see. Okay.

00:21:31.240 --> 00:21:36.370
You should at least stretch
and loosen up first.

00:21:40.210 --> 00:21:42.010
Is that it?

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:42.800
Hey.

00:21:42.800 --> 00:21:43.630
Hmm?

00:21:43.630 --> 00:21:47.260
Let's do our best.

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:51.260
Y-Yeah. Bye.

00:21:54.770 --> 00:21:57.190
Huh? What now?

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:01.860
Uh! I'm nervous. Do you have any advice?

00:22:01.860 --> 00:22:04.110
Huh? Go to sleep!

00:22:04.110 --> 00:22:06.910
Right! Good night!

00:22:06.910 --> 00:22:08.370
Sheesh.

00:22:08.370 --> 00:22:09.910
Big Bro!

00:22:10.910 --> 00:22:15.500
I'd love to see you play.

00:22:17.460 --> 00:22:19.380
Suit yourself.

00:22:27.010 --> 00:22:28.590
"Till prefecturals"

00:22:27.010 --> 00:22:28.590
"1 day"

00:22:28.590 --> 00:22:29.050
"Till prefecturals"
"1 day"

00:22:28.590 --> 00:22:29.050
Hell yeah!

00:22:29.050 --> 00:22:30.470
"Till prefecturals"

00:22:29.050 --> 00:22:30.470
Hell yeah!

